*     LIST8                                                             LAMI0010
      SUBROUTINE LAMIS                                                  LAMI0020
      COMMON I,II,IVAL,IP,IX,IZ,J,K,M,N,NM,R1,R3,R4,R5,RR,RW,ZEROT      LAMI0030
      COMMON MR,NR                                                      LAMI0040
D     DIMENSION R1(200),R3(200),R4(200),R5(200),RR(200,2),RW(200,2)     LAMI0050
      DIMENSION MR(200),NR(200)                                         LAMI0060
